{"seq":3,"slug":"syntax-basics","title":"语法基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/julia-scientific/foundations/syntax-basics","wordCount":1151,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"语法基础\">语法基础</h1><p>Julia 的语法是给写公式的人设计的:<code>2x + 3y</code> 里数字直接贴着变量就是乘法,<code>A&#39;</code> 是矩阵转置,<code>x ∈ S</code> 可以直接写成 Unicode 集合符号,<code>α = 0.1</code> 里希腊字母是合法标识符。这种刻意贴近数学与 MATLAB 习惯的设计,让科研人员几乎零成本上手。但语法之下也埋着性能伏笔——比如广播和数组的列优先约定。本篇只讲怎么写,语义为何能编译得快留给后续两章。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>语法层面有四个贯穿全篇的设计选择,它们既是写法习惯,也埋着性能伏笔:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>数学式表达</strong>:隐式乘法、Unicode 标识符、表达式默认返回值,让写公式的人零成本上手。</li>\n<li><strong>表达式语言</strong>:一切皆表达式,函数返回最后一个表达式的值,<code>return</code> 可省。</li>\n<li><strong><code>!</code> 后缀约定</strong>:函数名以 <code>!</code> 结尾表示就地修改参数,与分配控制直接相关。</li>\n<li><strong>点广播与融合</strong>:运算符加一个点即逐元素作用,多个广播自动融合成单次遍历。</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>语法表现</th>\n<th>后续影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数学式表达</td>\n<td><code>2x</code>、<code>α</code>、<code>A&#39;</code>、<code>x ∈ S</code></td>\n<td>上手成本低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表达式语言</td>\n<td>无 <code>return</code> 也可返回值</td>\n<td>函数定义三种写法可等价互换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>!</code> 后缀</td>\n<td><code>sort!</code> 就地、<code>sort</code> 返回副本</td>\n<td>性能调优中的分配控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>点广播</td>\n<td><code>x .^ 2 .+ 1</code>、<code>@.</code></td>\n<td>融合成单循环,是消除分配的主力</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>数组从 1 开始索引、列优先存储,这两条也属于必须记住的语法前提,其性能含义留到内存章节展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"变量-类型标注与基本类型\">变量、类型标注与基本类型</h2><p>变量无需声明类型,赋值即定义。你可以选择性地标注类型,标注主要用于函数参数派发和文档,而非性能必需:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"julia\" data-code=\"x = 42            # Int64&#10;y = 3.14          # Float64&#10;name = &quot;Julia&quot;    # String&#10;α = 0.1           # 希腊字母合法,用 \\alpha&lt;Tab&gt; 输入&#10;v = [1, 2, 3]     # Vector{Int64}&#10;&#10;function f(n::Integer)   # 参数标注约束派发&#10;    return n * 2&#10;end\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>x = 42            # Int64</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>y = 3.14          # Float64</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>name = \"Julia\"    # String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>α = 0.1           # 希腊字母合法,用 \\alpha&#x3C;Tab> 输入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>v = [1, 2, 3]     # Vector{Int64}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function f(n::Integer)   # 参数标注约束派发</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return n * 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Julia 的数值类型丰富且精确:<code>Int8/16/32/64/128</code>、<code>UInt*</code>、<code>Float16/32/64</code>、<code>Rational</code>(有理数 <code>3//4</code>)、<code>Complex</code>(<code>2 + 3im</code>)、任意精度的 <code>BigInt</code>/<code>BigFloat</code>。这些类型如何在派发体系中排布,见 <a href=\"type-system-dispatch\">类型系统与多重派发</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"控制流与函数\">控制流与函数</h2><p>控制流用关键字配 <code>end</code> 闭合,没有缩进语义,但社区约定四空格缩进:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"julia\" data-code=\"function classify(n)&#10;    if n &lt; 0&#10;        &quot;负&quot;&#10;    elseif n == 0&#10;        &quot;零&quot;&#10;    else&#10;        &quot;正&quot;&#10;    end&#10;end&#10;&#10;for i in 1:5            # 1:5 是惰性的 UnitRange,不分配数组&#10;    println(i^2)&#10;end&#10;&#10;s = 0&#10;while s &lt; 100&#10;    global s += 10&#10;end\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function classify(n)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if n &#x3C; 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"负\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    elseif n == 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"零\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    else</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"正\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>for i in 1:5            # 1:5 是惰性的 UnitRange,不分配数组</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println(i^2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>s = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>while s &#x3C; 100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    global s += 10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span></code></pre></div><p>函数定义有三种写法,且 Julia 是表达式语言——函数默认返回最后一个表达式的值,<code>return</code> 可省:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"julia\" data-code=\"# 完整形式&#10;function add(a, b)&#10;    a + b&#10;end&#10;&#10;# 赋值形式(数学味)&#10;square(x) = x^2&#10;&#10;# 匿名函数&#10;double = x -&gt; 2x&#10;map(x -&gt; x^2, 1:3)      # 高阶函数\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 完整形式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function add(a, b)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    a + b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 赋值形式(数学味)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>square(x) = x^2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 匿名函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>double = x -> 2x</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>map(x -> x^2, 1:3)      # 高阶函数</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>写法</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>function ... end</code></td>\n<td>多行逻辑、需要文档字符串</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>f(x) = ...</code></td>\n<td>单行数学定义,简洁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>x -&gt; ...</code></td>\n<td>传给 <code>map</code>/<code>filter</code> 等高阶函数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>值得注意:函数名以 <code>!</code> 结尾是社区约定,表示该函数会就地修改参数(如 <code>sort!</code> 原地排序,<code>sort</code> 返回副本)。这一约定在涉及数组分配的性能讨论中很关键,见 <a href=\"../performance/memory-arrays\">内存布局与数组</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"广播-把标量函数升维到数组\">广播:把标量函数升维到数组</h2><p>Julia 最具特色的语法是「点广播」。任何函数或运算符加一个点,就会逐元素作用于数组,且多个广播会自动「融合」成单次遍历,不产生中间临时数组。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"julia\" data-code=\"x = [1.0, 2.0, 3.0]&#10;y = [10.0, 20.0, 30.0]&#10;&#10;x .+ y          # 逐元素相加 -&gt; [11, 22, 33]&#10;sin.(x)         # 对每个元素求 sin&#10;x .^ 2 .+ 1     # 融合:一次遍历完成平方加一,无临时数组&#10;@. x^2 + 1      # @. 宏:给整行所有运算自动加点\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>x = [1.0, 2.0, 3.0]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>y = [10.0, 20.0, 30.0]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>x .+ y          # 逐元素相加 -> [11, 22, 33]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sin.(x)         # 对每个元素求 sin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>x .^ 2 .+ 1     # 融合:一次遍历完成平方加一,无临时数组</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@. x^2 + 1      # @. 宏:给整行所有运算自动加点</span></span></code></pre></div><p>广播融合(broadcast fusion)是性能与表达力的双赢:数学上你写的是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x) = x^2 + 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 这样的整体表达式,执行上 Julia 把它编译成单个循环。这背后是宏与编译器的配合,机制属于 <a href=\"../ecosystem/metaprogramming-macros\">元编程与宏</a> 的范畴。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;x .^ 2 .+ 1 表达式&quot;] --&gt; B[解析出广播树]&#10;  B --&gt; C[融合成一个逐元素 lambda]&#10;  C --&gt; D[生成单个循环&lt;br/&gt;无中间数组]&#10;  D --&gt; E[就地写入结果]\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"x .^ 2 .+ 1 表达式\"] --&gt; B[解析出广播树]\n  B --&gt; C[融合成一个逐元素 lambda]\n  C --&gt; D[生成单个循环&lt;br/&gt;无中间数组]\n  D --&gt; E[就地写入结果]</pre><h2 id=\"数组-索引与多维\">数组、索引与多维</h2><p>Julia 数组从 1 开始索引,且是列优先(column-major)存储——这与 C 的行优先相反,直接影响遍历顺序的缓存效率。本篇只讲索引语法,布局对性能的影响见 <a href=\"../performance/memory-arrays\">内存布局与数组</a>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"julia\" data-code=\"A = [1 2 3; 4 5 6]      # 2x3 矩阵,空格分列、分号分行&#10;A[1, 2]                 # 第 1 行第 2 列 = 2&#10;A[:, 1]                 # 第一列(整列)&#10;A[end, end]             # end 关键字表示末尾 = 6&#10;A[A .&gt; 3]               # 布尔索引,取所有大于 3 的元素&#10;&#10;A[2:end, :]             # 行切片:第 2 行到末尾&#10;comprehension = [i^2 for i in 1:5]        # 数组推导&#10;matrix = [i+j for i in 1:3, j in 1:3]     # 二维推导\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>A = [1 2 3; 4 5 6]      # 2x3 矩阵,空格分列、分号分行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>A[1, 2]                 # 第 1 行第 2 列 = 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>A[:, 1]                 # 第一列(整列)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>A[end, end]             # end 关键字表示末尾 = 6</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>A[A .> 3]               # 布尔索引,取所有大于 3 的元素</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>A[2:end, :]             # 行切片:第 2 行到末尾</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>comprehension = [i^2 for i in 1:5]        # 数组推导</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>matrix = [i+j for i in 1:3, j in 1:3]     # 二维推导</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"元组-字典与结构体\">元组、字典与结构体</h2><p>除了数组,日常还会用到三种常见容器,它们的语法各有侧重。元组(tuple)是定长、不可变、可异构的轻量序列,常用于多返回值;命名元组(named tuple)给元素起名;字典(<code>Dict</code>)是键值映射;结构体(<code>struct</code>)定义自己的复合类型。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"julia\" data-code=\"t = (1, &quot;a&quot;, 3.0)            # 元组,异构、不可变&#10;nt = (x=1, y=2)              # 命名元组,nt.x 取值&#10;d = Dict(&quot;a&quot; =&gt; 1, &quot;b&quot; =&gt; 2) # 字典&#10;d[&quot;a&quot;]                        # 取值&#10;&#10;# 多返回值本质是返回元组&#10;function minmax(v)&#10;    return minimum(v), maximum(v)&#10;end&#10;lo, hi = minmax([3, 1, 2])   # 解构赋值&#10;&#10;struct Point                 # 默认不可变&#10;    x::Float64&#10;    y::Float64&#10;end&#10;p = Point(1.0, 2.0)&#10;mutable struct Counter       # 需要可变时显式声明&#10;    n::Int&#10;end\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>t = (1, \"a\", 3.0)            # 元组,异构、不可变</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>nt = (x=1, y=2)              # 命名元组,nt.x 取值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>d = Dict(\"a\" => 1, \"b\" => 2) # 字典</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>d[\"a\"]                        # 取值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 多返回值本质是返回元组</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function minmax(v)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return minimum(v), maximum(v)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>lo, hi = minmax([3, 1, 2])   # 解构赋值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct Point                 # 默认不可变</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    x::Float64</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    y::Float64</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>p = Point(1.0, 2.0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>mutable struct Counter       # 需要可变时显式声明</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    n::Int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span></code></pre></div><p>结构体默认不可变,这与性能相关:不可变的小结构体能被编译器放上栈、内联存取,呼应 <a href=\"../performance/memory-arrays\">内存布局与数组</a> 里的取舍。给字段标注具体类型(或用类型参数)对类型稳定至关重要,详见 <a href=\"type-system-dispatch\">类型系统与多重派发</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Julia 语法贴近数学:隐式乘法、Unicode 标识符、表达式默认返回值,让科研人员低成本上手。</li>\n<li>控制流以关键字加 <code>end</code> 闭合,无缩进语义;函数有完整、赋值、匿名三种写法。</li>\n<li><code>!</code> 后缀约定表示就地修改,与性能调优中的分配控制相关。</li>\n<li>点广播加 <code>@.</code> 宏可把标量函数逐元素升维到数组,且自动融合成单次遍历,兼顾表达力与性能。</li>\n<li>数组从 1 开始索引、列优先存储,支持切片、<code>end</code>、布尔索引与推导式。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"语法基础","id":"语法基础"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"变量、类型标注与基本类型","id":"变量-类型标注与基本类型"},{"level":2,"text":"控制流与函数","id":"控制流与函数"},{"level":2,"text":"广播:把标量函数升维到数组","id":"广播-把标量函数升维到数组"},{"level":2,"text":"数组、索引与多维","id":"数组-索引与多维"},{"level":2,"text":"元组、字典与结构体","id":"元组-字典与结构体"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"类型系统与多重派发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/julia-scientific/foundations/type-system-dispatch"},"next":{"title":"JIT 编译与 LLVM","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/julia-scientific/performance/jit-compilation"}}